message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "FastAPI Niche Assistant"
abstract: >-
  A small language model service that answers questions about the FastAPI web
  framework. It provides a LoRA fine-tuning pipeline for TinyLlama-1.1B-Chat on a
  curated FastAPI question-answer dataset (351 training and 108 held-out evaluation
  examples), an evaluation harness that gates every model release on the held-out
  set, and a production service with a native and an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API,
  streaming, optional retrieval over the FastAPI documentation, per-user API keys,
  bounded admission control, and an edge layer with caching and origin failover.
  The deployed model is the first fine-tuned release, v2026.11.13-2b04940, a LoRA
  fine-tune of TinyLlama-1.1B-Chat-v1.0 served as a Q4_K_M GGUF.
